---
import "../styles/global.css";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";

import harpeImageSmall from "../assets/logo/logo-small-light.svg";
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="footer-brand">
    <div class="footer-logo">
      <Image src={harpeImageSmall} alt="Harpe Logo" class="footer-logo-image" />
      <span>RÅDGIVNING ORFEUS</span>
    </div>
    <p>Rådgivningen Orfeus – fællesskab for familier berørt af misbrug (RO) er en frivillig organisation, som yder gratis rådgivning og støtte til mennesker ramt af misbrug.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="footer-links">
    <div class="footer-column">
      <h3>Socials</h3>
      <a href="#">Facebook</a>
      <a href="#">Instagram</a>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-column">
      <h3>Vores sider</h3>
      <a href="#">Rådgivningstilbud</a>
      <a href="#">Om os</a>
      <a href="#">Bliv Rådgiver</a>
      <a href="#">Bigdragsydere</a>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-column">
      <h3>Kontakt</h3>
      <p>+45 70604640</p>
      <p>kontakt@raadgivningen-orfeus.dk</p>
      <p>CVR: 46258657</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <style>
    .site-footer {
      background-color: var(--gray-500);
      color: white;
      padding: 100px 120px 15px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 100px;
    }

    .footer-brand {
      max-width: 400px;
    }

    .footer-logo {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .footer-logo span {
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .footer-brand p {
      margin-top: 20px;
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    .footer-links {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      column-gap: 40px;
      row-gap: 44px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .footer-column {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 2px;
    }

    .footer-column h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-size: 16px;
      margin: 0 0 4px;
    }

    .footer-column a,
    .footer-column p {
      color: white;
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    .footer-column a {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .footer-column p {
      margin: 0;
    }

    @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
      .site-footer {
        padding: 50px 20px 20px;

        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;

        gap: 40px;
      }

      .footer-brand {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 320px;
      }

      .footer-logo {
        gap: 10px;
      }

      .footer-logo-image {
        width: 40px;
        height: auto;
      }

      .footer-logo span {
        font-size: 16px;
      }

      .footer-brand p {
        margin-top: 14px;

        font-size: 12px;
        line-height: 1.45;
      }

      .footer-links {
        width: 100%;

        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;

        column-gap: 30px;
        row-gap: 30px;
      }

      .footer-column {
        gap: 3px;
      }

      .footer-column h3 {
        font-size: 14px;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
      }

      .footer-column a,
      .footer-column p {
        font-size: 12px;
        line-height: 1.45;
      }
    }
  </style>
</footer>
